    - For matrix transformations: $\mathbf{x}' = (M^{-1} \cdot [\mathbf{x}, 1]^T)_{xyz}$ [S6, S11, unofficial].
    - For translation: $\mathbf{x}' = \mathbf{x} - \mathbf{d}$ [S8, unofficial].
